<p>Heh. What happens when you mix the Blair Witch Project with spooky animals and video oddity creepiness? You get Dex's 3000Con entry is what.</p>
<p>In all seriousness, I liked reading through the logs. The descriptions there are vivid and really give this article a nice chilling atmosphere. I actually wish that there was more here, because I felt that things could have been drawn out a little more before the various hikers met their fates. Still, what is here is neat and very much worth an upvote.</p>
<p>+1.</p>

